						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
						<div class="rounded-xl
border border-[#111827]/15 p-4">
							<p class="text-sm text-[#111827]/60">Words</p>
