					</p>
				</details>
				<details class="group py-5">
					<summary
						class="flex
cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold"
					>
						Can I use Wordix on my phone? <span
							class="text-xl transition-transform
group-open:rotate-45"
							aria-hidden="true">+</span
						>
					</summary>
					<p class="mt-3 pr-8
text-sm leading-7 text-[#111827]/70">
